From 07b9a47d10006dc9bbac96bfdf03ad1a28d7bf45 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mythiccal <cwood2014.cw@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 15:11:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Petal: Async Pathfinding

Makes most pathfinding-related work happen asynchronously.
Based on Petal (https://github.com/Bloom-host/Petal) and DivineMC.
Licensed under GPL-3.0.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
